{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_04CB80","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"<R=幽灵,FANTASMA>不一定总能被肉眼看见。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=幽灵,FANTASMA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":52,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"明明什么都看不见，却只能听到声音……遇到这种情况，肯定就是有<R=幽灵,FANTASMA>。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=幽灵,FANTASMA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":112,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"要是遇到这种情况，不妨拍张照片。肯定会拍到什么东西。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"诶？你问为什么肉眼看不见，照片里却能拍出来？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"这你问我，我也不知道啊……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"嗯……会不会是<R=幽灵,FANTASMA>在迷惑人的心智？","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=幽灵,FANTASMA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":64,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"其实它明明就在那里，却作用于人的内心，让人以为自己看不见。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"但相机没有心，所以就能正常拍下来。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"对啊！肯定就是这样！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""}]}